"captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "rancangan_screenshot_not_stored", "label": "Screenshot trade tidak disimpan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a76.1, \u00a711", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ribuan trade \u00d7 satu gambar menggelembungkan storage tanpa nilai tambah; gambar hanya perlu hidup selama form terbuka, jejaknya cukup di ai_raw."}, {"id": "rancangan_ai_raw", "label": "Kolom ai_raw (jejak bacaan Gemini)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74, \u00a712", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sempat tidak pernah tertulis karena TradeRequest tidak memvalidasinya sehingga selalu terbuang; diperbaiki di revisi kedua."}, {"id": "rancangan_layered_verification", "label": "Verifikasi berlapis import AI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a76.1, \u00a711", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "is_trade_screenshot=false ditolak 422; symbol/direction/entry_price kosong ditolak 422; sisanya tetap lewat TradeRequest. Mencegah gambar sembarangan mengisi form dengan data setengah jadi. Model diinstruksikan mengembalikan null daripada menebak, dan exit_price tidak boleh menyalin S/L atau T/P."}, {"id": "rancangan_timezone_jakarta", "label": "Waktu disimpan dalam Asia/Jakarta", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a79, \u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Satu pengguna satu zona; menyimpan langsung waktu lokal menghapus seluruh kelas bug batas hari pada kalender dan aturan harian."}, {"id": "rancangan_typescript_pin", "label": "TypeScript dipatok ^5.9", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TS 7 (port Go) belum punya API yang dibutuhkan @vue/compiler-sfc untuk resolusi tipe lintas file di Vite 8."}, {"id": "rancangan_bunny_fonts", "label": "Font self-host via bunny() laravel-vite-plugin", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a71, \u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fitur bawaan Laravel 13 menggantikan @fontsource: dua dependensi npm hilang, font tetap self-hosted."}, {"id": "rancangan_currency_usc", "label": "Mata uang akun USD / USC / IDR", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a711", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "USC (akun sen) bukan kode ISO 4217, jadi Intl.NumberFormat diberi jalur khusus di money(): angka + akhiran kode."}, {"id": "rancangan_price_useformat", "label": "price() di useFormat.ts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a712", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "decimal(18,5) selalu mengembalikan 5 desimal (4404.51000); nol di ujung tidak membawa informasi sehingga dipangkas."}, {"id": "rancangan_rr_columns", "label": "Kolom RR menampilkan R hasil dan R rencana", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a712", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Posisi yang kena SL/TP persis membuat R hasil selalu \u22121,00R atau sama dengan R rencana; menampilkan keduanya membuat baris kembali bercerita."}, {"id": "rancangan_service_worker", "label": "public/sw.js (cache aset build saja)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "RANCANGAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a79, \u00a712", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contri